    "q-73002": {
      "dom_id": "step-q73002",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "$2!\\,3!=$",
      "worked_solution": "The given expression is a product of two factorials.\n\n- Computing $2!$ using the definition, we get\n\n$$\n2!=2\\cdot 1=2.\n$$\n\n- Computing $3!$ using the definition, we get\n\n$$\n3!=3\\cdot 2\\cdot 1=6.\n$$\n\nFinally, we can evaluate the given expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2!\\,3! & =2!\\cdot 3! \\\\  & =2\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =12\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
